  "sort_order": "132997",
  "description": "<p>Designed for impact absorption, our 10 Inch Black Leather Jump Boots feature a cushioned insole that helps protect your feet by reducing impact from jumping and striking. Reinforced Grip: Hit the ground with an oil-resistant beveled outsole for better movement on rugged outdoor terrains and in various environments. Breathable Moisture Protection: The black military uniform boots utilize a storm welt design that helps wick away moisture, keeping your feet dry in diverse conditions. Essential Support: The paratrooper boots feature a 10-inch height and 12-eyelet lace system for a secure fit that helps prevent ankle rolls in the field. The internal steel stank helps reduce stain on your heel and calf while providing additional stability and support. Up to the Challenge: From military personnel and officers to outdoor adventurers, these uniform jump boots easily withstand rigorous use through demanding situations while remaining comfortable, dry, and uniform-ready.</p>",
